# Reserved for Phase 2+.

# controllers/  — request/response layer (thin): validate -> call service -> send ApiResponse
# services/    — business logic: exchange-rate resolution (manual > scraper), freshness filtering
# repositories/— data access: Supabase (PostgreSQL) queries. No SQL in services/controllers.
# routes/      — Express routers: one per resource, mounted under /api/v1 in app.ts
# validators/  — Zod schemas per route; validated in controllers (never in repositories)
